<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;">$</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> python</span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> -V</span></span>
